:2px solid #F39130;}.note-box{background:#f0f7ff;border:1px solid #2B3E71;padding:12px 14px;margin-top:16px;border-radius:4px;}.note-box strong{color:#20295B;}.note-box .note-content{font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;color:#333;display:block;margin-top:6px;}.synthese-text{font-size:12px;line-height:1.55;color:#333;text-align:justify;}.majo-banner{background:#fef9e7;border:1px solid #f1c40f;padding:8px 12px;margin:8px 0 0;border-radius:4px;font-size:11px;color:#7d6608;}.majo-banner strong{color:#5a4604;}.footer{margin-top:24px;font-size:9.5px;color:#888;border-top:1px solid #eee;padding-top:10px;text-align:center;}@media print{body{background:#fff;font-size:10.5px;}.page{box-shadow:none;margin:0;padding:1.4cm;}@page{margin:1.2cm;size:A4;}}</style></head><body><div class="page"><div class="header"><div class="logo-text">Expertise Optimisation des Retraites</div><div class="doc-title">Simulations Retraite</div></div><div class="client-box"><div><strong>[CLIENT_CIVILITE] [CLIENT_NOM]</strong><br><strong>NÉ(E) LE :</strong> [CLIENT_DDN]</div><div style="text-align:right;"><strong>DATE :</strong> [DATE_SIM]<br><strong>ENFANTS :</strong> [CLIENT_ENFANTS]</div></div><h2>1. Synthèse de la situation</h2><p class="synthese-text">[ANALYSE_SITUATION]</p>[MAJO_BANNER]<h2>2. Tableau Comparatif Détaillé</h2><table><thead><tr><th>Éléments de calcul</th><th style="width:32%;">Votre situation</th></tr></thead><tbody>[H1_BLOCK][H2_BLOCK][H3_ROWS]</tbody></table>[PROJECTION_TABLE][MAJO_DETAIL_BLOCK]<div class="note-box"><strong>NOTE TECHNIQUE DU CONSULTANT :</strong><span class="note-content">[NOTE_CONSULTANT]</span></div><div class="footer">Document confidentiel établi par EOR Consultants — Simulation au [DATE_SIM] — Projections indicatives, non contractuelles.</div></div></body></html>';

